<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-17272] Logical recovery works incorrectly for encrypted caches</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-17272</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When encryption is enabled for a particular cache, its WAL records get encrypted and wrapped in an &lt;tt&gt;EncryptedRecord&lt;/tt&gt;. This encrypted record type is considered a &lt;tt&gt;PHYSICAL&lt;/tt&gt; record, which leads to such records being omitted during logical recovery regardless of the fact that it can contain logical records.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
